[14015]="70064473\n1\tReturn to your spawning den. Speak with Lenathron the Corruptor\tMalavin sent you back to where your journey in the Ettenmoors began to speak with Lenathron the corruptor.\n",
[14016]="70064476\n1\tReturn to your spawning den. Speak with Ashrokil the Corruptor.\tMalavan sent you back to where your journey in the Ettenmoors began to speak with Ashrokil the corruptor.\n",
